<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Profile Box</title>
    <style>
        /* Ensures the page itself has no margins */
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }

        /* Your profile box styles */
        .profile-box {
            background-color: white;
            color: #222;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 24px;
            max-width: 720px; /* Max width on desktop */
            width: auto; /* Allows it to shrink */
            margin: 0 auto; /* Center it */
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            line-height: 1.6;
            /* This tells the box to fit its content */
            box-sizing: border-box; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="profile-box">
        <p style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
            <strong>[~]$ whoami</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
            Cyber-Security Consultant and Developer with interests in Offensive Security,
            *nix-based Systems, Android, Reverse Engineering, and Programming; loves Command Line, FOSS.
            <a href="#" style="color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">Read more...</a>
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;">
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
                <a href="#" style="color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">🔗 Link Tree</a> – Links to all my social media profiles.
            </li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
                <a href="#" style="color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">📰 RSS Feed</a> – Subscribe to this blog using RSS aggregators.
            </li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
                📧 Reach out to me at <a href="mailto:contact@yourmail.com" style="color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">contact@yourmail.com</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;">
            <a href="#" style="margin-right:16px; color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="#" style="color:#3366cc; text-decoration:none;">Twitter/X</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
